00:05:42.759 --> 00:05:43.593
I learn nothing.

00:05:43.593 --> 00:05:45.178
Mm.

00:05:50.266 --> 00:05:52.602
Oh, gosh, that went in my nose.

00:05:52.602 --> 00:05:53.936
