00:06:48.866 --> 00:06:49.700
There's some sweetness to it.

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:51.077
I don't know what's causing that.

00:06:53.871 --> 00:06:54.705
Woof!

00:06:56.958 --> 00:06:57.792
